# Загрузчик (aeboot).
@cut
AEBOOT 2.1<dim>  ·  signed loader</dim>

@rows width=12
  entry | aether 9.1 (halcyon) | | default
  kernel | aek 5.8.14-hal  vault=/dev/vault0 | dim
recovery    <dim>aether 9.1 recovery  </dim><error>[clearance ARC required]</error>
diagnostics <dim>memory, vault  </dim><warning>[locked]</warning>

@bar loading aek 5.8.14-hal   | 900-1600
@task verifying image signature | OK | 400-800
@task measuring into pcr 8-9 | OK | 200-500
@rows width=12
  handoff | aek entry 0xffffffff81000000 | dim
@read
